<ul>
<li><strong>Mac Dock icon appearance.</strong> ADSwift’s Dock icon now
keeps its intended rounded app-icon shape on macOS.</li>
<li><strong>Toolbar layout while resizing.</strong> Table controls now
stay readable when the window is resized, instead of overlapping or
collapsing into clipped text.</li>
